{
  "id": "59",
  "title": "人鑑论",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“人鑑论”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "洪濛肇判，甲子攸生，幽显而变通莫测，沉潜于二理尤深；二十四字之精神妙用，亿千万人凶吉灼知。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-e59fe0eff789a75c9b1f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日生为主，年长为君；先论根本，察贵贱之由易见。假使粗识深藏之体，孰得而知；盖，贵者虽吉，贱由不易。森列三才，势有权衡轻重；包罗八卦，自存规矩方圆。天道尚有盈亏，人事岂无反覆；或先贫而终富，或先败而后兴，当捨短而从长，毋取彼而捨此。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-761f8d134ba87885968d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱俱嫌其一字，大醇亦求其小疵，详察其言，毋轻以断。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-7fd54dfd35a47384bd84-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官在禄乡，伊尹负阿衡之任。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-bb4e224385296f0ab5e9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时居贵地，傅巖兴作相之臣。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-8a67d8908bdee3c128f1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "生逢贵格，入仕为臺阁之尊。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-c99ce452c59970b02df4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "重叠鬼生，乐道有山林之兴。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-964bbb3533583b8a9a6a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "是知，居官居贵，五行醇而不疵；多滞多忧，八字杂而又战。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-6af637833e34cc968f55-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "根甘裔苦，贾谊屈于长沙。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-5a62a5376a2b4421031d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "源浊流清，太公兴于渭水。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-24920a352d7ee82ca1ec-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "禄马同乡，而会登臺阁。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-f24dda142ef3341848d7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀印重旺，而早入科名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-c755ebde05eabe0728b6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "兄多逢弟，宜嗟范子之贫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-18a11636bcb5d26c5b31-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "父叠生身，可比老彭之寿。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-22908582ee761948a0e4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "夹官夹贵日时值，而峻宇雕樑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-9fbff825bcc416541547-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "劫财夺马岁时逢，而蓬门瓮牖。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-2370eb4f90abd020e54c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "嗣位剋绝，鹊之巢而鳩占之。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-76aa144ef66c6e5c202f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "妻位犯伤，鸞之孤而凤无匹偶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-8b7fc928603f30bd448a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "行运背禄，昔日富而今日贫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-c7983f74dfc77fae2f87-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "命遇旺身，昨日悲而今日笑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-a1baab994eea755b4def-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱坐学堂之上，回也不愚。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-0854bd4c25bdaedc983d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "三元助墓库之中，丘也好学。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-4610cb48065784481a4d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "年逢官贵，才高立解成名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-ca3c65284198846d2723-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时值偏财，家富又添好业。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-86be732a5cb8171d942e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚行丙地，祷尔于祗。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-7a22d50c59d5b7aebac5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬入戌乡，胡不遄死。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-6e274327f07858c7e4da-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伯牛有疾，缘战剋以交差。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-6616d820cf0d8c1d8781-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "司马何忧，盖比和而无位。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-f6d5133e1df553365f16-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身中衰弱，逢吉运以为凶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-814b41129bc27ddc4511-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "命坐坚牢，遇祸年而反福。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-ffb83c5b47b2ba0cada4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀须重而多合，何伤日月之明。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-858d2e2c73cfef65ba5c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "禄虽多而有破，难际风云之会。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-94a67bc3566720307cdb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "遇而不遇，庚辛在壬癸之乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-13311cc8488d51931330-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "忧而不忧，甲乙行丙丁之地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-f60b62465dd6be70249c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "或若，生逢败绝，郑谷归耕；禄马病衰，冯唐皓首。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-1742a92143317b2de8da-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "九宫旺相，难逃邀我桑中。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-76a68450d43ac540c773-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱合和，未免题诗叶上。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-ce140d3a211e822abef0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "西施美貌，自身多带长生。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-d293729a29211bb3a234-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "绿珠坠楼，凶恶又逢七杀。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-e259104640c919e7ee23-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "孤鸞入命，妻哭夫而夫哭妇。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-877b198846a7b3c0a25f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "烟花绊身，女求男而男求女。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-fcd40202429414b03996-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "头目陷，而肢体相亏。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-dc1a952717b2a228f6cf-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财有耗，而田宅有害。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-5a40bb483e2062bc50ce-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "生时若遇刑冲，一生屡乏。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-b6f73e3525b9ccf2e912-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "岁月若临劫夺，百岁孤寒。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-fdf8c645067356b447ba-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财入财窠，不贵即当大富。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-f91d9484a6c20cb0fd7a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀居太岁，居安不可虑危。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-b05720c5ae240ff23067-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若乃，官星透露，未可便作贵推；杀星下攻，曷不便为凶兆。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-b9c3708b96140cca4d7d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "大抵，归禄喜逢于印綬，刑杀宜值于济和。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-6f7069a63652dc8dabba-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "是以当忧不忧，闻喜不喜，考其根而明其实，论其始而究其终；故知，失其本而忘其末，不救其实而义有餘。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-8d568ad6d62951edda4f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "是以，妻宫有剋，少年无早娶之人；鬼位逢伤，末岁损成家之子。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-3403d5be2a75e9e9a838-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "生平不已，而寿算松桩。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-b3b4db0ca0ab4e41df3e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财禄带多，而福姿蒲柳。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-1b3f926f4ba56fc72a0a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "源清者，其流必远。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-efc47b4603e2cb9196ce-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "本壮者，其叶必荣。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-3c593373b59751c400b1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "三命冠群，不贵即当大富。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-522dc3e82e87b50561d5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "九宫弱陷，怕凶运大忌凶年。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-d26ca6dbc042428f32c1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "千条万绪，当求不见之形；百派一源，贵得弥身之地。详陈本末，备察盈亏，澄神定虑，深略沉机，可考而知，不言而喻；后之君子，鉴以前贤，言术者十常八九，造首者百无一二。辞简而意微，言近而指远，为之贤乎已，鉴命无忽诸。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "59-79b46549f44514187403-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
